WEBVTT

00:04.070 --> 00:05.410
All right!

00:06.060 --> 00:08.350
Time to get day two started!

00:08.350 --> 00:11.400
Let's see... The event is five days, right?

00:11.400 --> 00:14.100
And we completed up through the 
third floor yesterday, so...

00:14.100 --> 00:15.950
We're going at a good pace.

00:16.280 --> 00:20.660
It'd be pretty cool to be the first 
ones to clear the top floor, though.

00:20.660 --> 00:23.630
Yeah! We aim to be the fastest!

00:25.310 --> 00:34.130
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

01:52.170 --> 01:54.000
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

01:54.650 --> 01:59.320
<b>Maxing Defense </b>and <b>Tower Conquest</b>.

01:57.470 --> 01:59.460
The weather's so nice!

01:59.460 --> 02:01.930
Look, Sally! We're almost to the sea!

02:05.140 --> 02:06.530
Maple, up there!

02:09.690 --> 02:12.670
A sea turtle! Wow! Oh, wow!

02:12.670 --> 02:14.780
Is that the boss of this floor?

02:14.780 --> 02:18.030
Sally, Sally! Don't you wanna 
try riding on that turtle?

02:18.030 --> 02:18.960
Huh?

02:18.960 --> 02:22.240
Just a little! Just a little ride! Okay?

02:22.240 --> 02:25.080
All right, just a little one.

02:27.080 --> 02:31.050
I've fine-tuned the appearance rate 
of monsters on the third floor.

02:31.050 --> 02:32.040
Thanks!

02:32.040 --> 02:34.890
Whew, I'm beat. Do we have any energy drinks?

02:34.890 --> 02:37.380
Maple and Sally are on 
the fourth floor, right?

02:37.380 --> 02:38.510
How are they doing?

02:38.510 --> 02:40.450
They appear to be relaxing.

02:40.450 --> 02:41.720
Huh?!

02:54.580 --> 02:55.920
Yeah, they're...

02:55.920 --> 02:57.360
...relaxing, all right.

02:57.360 --> 03:00.880
<i>Maple, we need to get to the next floor soon.</i>

03:00.880 --> 03:04.830
<i>Yeah, you're right. I'll miss 
this nice, cool shell, though...</i>

03:04.830 --> 03:08.130
Oh, it appears they're about 
to start fighting the boss.

03:04.830 --> 03:08.900
Secretary

03:08.130 --> 03:09.640
I-It'll be fine!

03:09.640 --> 03:12.810
It <i>is</i> the floor boss, after 
all! It's plenty strong!

03:12.810 --> 03:16.800
Yeah! It doesn't take damage through 
the shell, so from up there...

03:16.800 --> 03:17.800
[Web User]!

03:21.590 --> 03:23.260
[Seeping Chaos]!

03:25.220 --> 03:26.510
[Triple Slash]!

03:26.510 --> 03:27.970
[Fireball]!

03:31.810 --> 03:33.310
They pulverized it.

03:38.070 --> 03:39.320
I've got this!

03:39.320 --> 03:40.700
[Arms of the Warrior]!

03:43.980 --> 03:46.170
Looks like elemental attacks work.

03:46.170 --> 03:47.700
[Flame Cutter]!

03:52.830 --> 03:53.930
Kuromu!

03:53.930 --> 03:55.320
Are you all right?

03:55.320 --> 03:58.300
Yeah! This kinda thing is 
what great shielders are for!

03:59.190 --> 04:00.590
Guys! Below you!

04:03.930 --> 04:06.490
That was a close shave. 
But our real target is...

04:06.490 --> 04:07.260
Here it comes!

04:13.480 --> 04:14.940
Let's do this, Sis!

04:14.940 --> 04:15.810
Yeah!

04:15.810 --> 04:17.940
I'll create an opening! Take it from there!

04:20.530 --> 04:22.320
I've been saving my latest creation for you!

04:26.240 --> 04:27.750
[Double Strike]!

04:29.950 --> 04:32.970
They're not Maple, but they're 
frightening in their own way.

04:33.710 --> 04:35.170
I'm glad to have them around, though.

04:35.410 --> 04:37.950
You think everything's going 
okay for Maple and Sally?

04:37.950 --> 04:40.620
Sally would definitely have 
trouble with this floor.

04:40.620 --> 04:43.170
Yeah. I wonder how they'll handle it.

04:56.670 --> 04:58.440
Okay! Floor cleared!

04:58.440 --> 05:00.350
It's safe now, Sally.

05:04.820 --> 05:06.160
I got carsick...

05:07.030 --> 05:09.690
Never would've guessed 
they'd beat it that way...

05:09.690 --> 05:12.120
I mean, holding your 
friend inside your mouth?

05:12.120 --> 05:15.910
I wonder what it's like 
inside that thing's mouth.

05:15.910 --> 05:17.010
That's sexual harassment.

05:17.010 --> 05:17.830
It is?!

05:19.310 --> 05:21.300
Show us the top team.

05:26.170 --> 05:30.470
Payne... Is it me, or have I 
been doing a lot of work here?

05:30.470 --> 05:35.710
True. Being a small party does 
put more strain on our support.

05:35.710 --> 05:40.060
Yeah, but you're the one who said 
we should do this as a small party.

05:40.060 --> 05:43.530
You gotta take responsibility for 
the things you say, Frederica.

05:43.530 --> 05:45.740
I know, but...

05:45.740 --> 05:48.570
I bet you got triggered by Sally, right?

05:48.570 --> 05:51.460
When she said she'd be tackling 
this with just Maple.

05:51.460 --> 05:53.200
Wh-Who cares?!

05:53.430 --> 05:56.550
Still, conquering this with a 
small party will be good for us.

05:56.550 --> 05:58.680
Yeah! No doubt about it!

05:58.680 --> 06:01.160
A brilliant way to look 
at it! I am impressed!

06:01.920 --> 06:03.940
Why are they with us?

06:03.940 --> 06:06.260
Well, they'll make good shields, at least.

06:07.650 --> 06:08.370
Incoming.

06:09.210 --> 06:11.850
Good luck! We're rooting for you!

06:11.850 --> 06:14.060
Seriously, why <i>are</i> they here?

06:21.980 --> 06:23.200
Counting on you!

06:23.200 --> 06:24.190
Same to you!

06:24.410 --> 06:25.990
Hey! Darn it!

06:26.350 --> 06:27.590
[Multi-Acceleration]!

06:27.590 --> 06:28.900
[Multi-Energize]!

06:28.900 --> 06:31.260
[War Song]! [Boost Morale]!

06:31.990 --> 06:34.340
[Fissure]!

06:37.780 --> 06:40.120
[Bypass Armor]! [Whirlwind Flurry]!

06:40.120 --> 06:42.770
Expand area! [Sword of Judgment]!

06:45.420 --> 06:46.380
Whoops!

06:46.380 --> 06:48.050
[Power Axe]!

06:49.720 --> 06:53.260
Frederica! Give all of our buffs to Payne!

06:53.260 --> 06:55.970
Okay! [Multi-Augment]!

06:59.910 --> 07:01.400
[Sword of Eradication]!

07:04.890 --> 07:07.850
Hey, that was some impressive power, Payne.

07:08.260 --> 07:10.020
We're through half the tower now.

07:10.020 --> 07:13.570
As long as we have skills and stamina 
left, I'd like to keep moving.

07:13.570 --> 07:15.320
I'm still doing fine.

07:15.320 --> 07:17.750
And I want us to be the 
first to clear this thing!

07:17.750 --> 07:19.560
Yep, agreed.

07:21.710 --> 07:23.900
I guess I really hate losing, too.

07:25.450 --> 07:29.090
No matter how far we go, it's ice 
and snow as far as the eye can see.

07:29.090 --> 07:31.970
We'll be counting on Mii when 
it comes to the boss fight.

07:31.970 --> 07:33.950
We finally made it.

07:33.950 --> 07:35.380
Ugh, I'm wiped.

07:35.380 --> 07:40.370
Thank you for finding and disarming all the 
traps as we came down the cliff, Markus.

07:40.370 --> 07:44.050
Well, those were some pretty hardcore traps.

07:44.050 --> 07:47.310
If we'd gotten caught... Whew, 
I shudder to think of it.

07:47.740 --> 07:51.320
What should we do, Mii? Rest for a bit?

07:51.320 --> 07:52.650
Yes, we should.

07:53.010 --> 07:56.620
Since Markus is so exhausted, 
we'll rest for five minutes.

07:56.620 --> 07:58.560
Then we'll move on.

07:58.560 --> 07:59.250
Got it!

07:59.250 --> 08:00.240
Got it.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.260
Understood.

08:03.550 --> 08:05.890
<i>I wonder how far Maple's gotten.</i>

08:07.630 --> 08:10.850
What?! Payne's party is 
already on the eighth floor?

08:10.850 --> 08:14.380
Seems so. Frederica messaged me,
and she was kinda bragging about it.

08:14.380 --> 08:17.210
I'd heard they were working 
with just a small party.

08:17.210 --> 08:18.340
I'm impressed.

08:18.340 --> 08:19.330
We gotta make sure...

08:19.330 --> 08:20.850
...we don't fall behind!

08:20.850 --> 08:24.770
It's good to be so spirited, but 
we should rest for the night.

08:24.770 --> 08:27.060
Where are you two in the 
tower, Maple and Sally?

08:27.060 --> 08:31.060
Well, we beat the sixth floor, 
so the seventh is next.

08:31.060 --> 08:35.630
I'm personally curious to know how 
Sally got through the fifth floor.

08:35.630 --> 08:37.920
Yeah, no comment on that.

08:37.920 --> 08:39.580
Oh, it's from Mii.

08:39.580 --> 08:43.610
<i>How's it going for you two? 
We're working on the seventh floor!</i>

08:39.580 --> 08:45.790
<b>Mii</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:45.790
<b>How's it going for you two? 
We're working on the seventh floor!</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:45.790
<b>Let's get tea together again when this is over!</b>

08:43.610 --> 08:45.790
<i>Let's get tea together 
again when this is over!</i>

08:46.330 --> 08:48.950
Wow, she's working hard!

08:48.950 --> 08:51.660
Okay! I can't fall behind, either!

08:55.470 --> 08:57.060
[Split-Sword]!

09:03.930 --> 09:04.940
[Flame]!

09:09.750 --> 09:12.320
[Breath of the Gods]! [Healing Light]!

09:12.320 --> 09:13.750
Nice, Misery!

09:13.750 --> 09:16.280
Th-Thanks. You saved my skin.

09:17.740 --> 09:19.110
Here it comes again!

09:19.110 --> 09:20.080
[Heavy Fire]!

09:21.660 --> 09:24.200
We need to start by melting all that down.

09:24.200 --> 09:26.760
Misery, help me keep my MP up.

09:27.090 --> 09:28.250
Understood!

09:28.510 --> 09:29.880
[Flare Accel]!

09:31.090 --> 09:32.550
Take this! [Inferno]!

09:35.260 --> 09:37.720
The seventh floor was a piece 
of cake for Mii's party.

09:37.720 --> 09:39.720
Maple Tree is fighting hard, too!

09:39.720 --> 09:41.690
Maple's party and Kuromu's party

09:41.690 --> 09:44.150
have reached the eighth floor 
at nearly the same time.

09:44.150 --> 09:46.690
Though Payne's party got 
there just a little sooner...

09:46.690 --> 09:49.650
Of course it's those three guilds again!

09:54.110 --> 09:56.290
Oh, not again!

09:56.290 --> 09:58.300
We can't see it anymore!

09:58.930 --> 09:59.570
Where is it?

10:01.580 --> 10:02.390
No—

10:03.290 --> 10:04.520
Kasumi!

10:09.150 --> 10:10.960
Sorry. Thanks for the help.

10:11.480 --> 10:16.550
Maybe I should've given more anti-sleep 
potions to Maple and Sally, too...

10:21.010 --> 10:25.220
Sleep status is supposed to 
end after you take one hit...

10:26.140 --> 10:29.900
But since Maple doesn't take 
damage, she won't wake up.

10:32.650 --> 10:35.790
Yes! It stopped her by putting her to sleep!

10:35.790 --> 10:37.820
Status abnormalities FTW!

10:37.820 --> 10:40.630
Oh. Sally has defeated the boss.

10:40.630 --> 10:41.620
D'oh!

10:44.410 --> 10:46.910
Hup... and... hup!

10:47.340 --> 10:49.080
Maple, you okay?

10:49.080 --> 10:51.210
Yeah, I'm managing!

10:51.590 --> 10:54.490
I guess I can't call Syrup in here, either...

10:54.490 --> 10:56.450
Maple! Get to the next one!

10:58.980 --> 11:00.720
That was close!

11:00.720 --> 11:01.870
Up we go...

11:03.010 --> 11:04.600
Wh-What's that?!

11:14.900 --> 11:16.930
Maple, it's here.

11:16.930 --> 11:19.150
Okay! As long as I know where it is...

11:19.150 --> 11:20.400
[Machine God]!

11:20.400 --> 11:22.150
[Deploy Armaments]!

11:24.170 --> 11:25.950
Take us straight to the boss!

11:34.760 --> 11:36.090
Knock-back?!

11:36.340 --> 11:37.300
Maple!

11:42.570 --> 11:43.890
There you go.

11:43.890 --> 11:45.390
Thanks, Sally.

11:47.000 --> 11:49.260
Okay, time for our counterattack!

11:49.260 --> 11:50.270
Roger!

11:53.940 --> 11:56.090
With such a big target...

11:56.090 --> 11:57.440
[Wind Cutter]!

11:58.940 --> 12:00.030
Way to go, Sally!

12:00.250 --> 12:02.260
Okay, now I'll...

12:02.260 --> 12:03.070
[Hydra]!

12:03.070 --> 12:04.570
A counter of the same type? Which means...

12:05.000 --> 12:07.160
It mimics our attacks! Be careful!

12:07.470 --> 12:10.060
What?! <i>Now</i> you tell me!

12:13.270 --> 12:15.590
Ugh, this isn't gonna be easy.

12:15.590 --> 12:19.090
Our attacks <i>are</i> working, 
though. That means...

12:21.300 --> 12:25.390
It'll take a long time to just chip away 
at it while watching for its counters.

12:25.390 --> 12:26.850
[Drill Armaments]!

12:26.850 --> 12:27.680
Deploy!

12:28.490 --> 12:29.310
Maple?!

12:32.140 --> 12:33.820
[Heavy Body]!

12:34.850 --> 12:36.810
Knock-back won't affect me now!

13:06.090 --> 13:07.590
We did it, Sally!

13:07.590 --> 13:08.930
I guess we did.

13:08.930 --> 13:12.720
Looks like Maple and Sally finally 
made it to the tenth floor.

13:12.720 --> 13:16.410
Mii and Payne, too. Nearly all the top 
players got there around the same time.

13:16.410 --> 13:19.150
They got this far much 
faster than we expected.

13:21.220 --> 13:24.360
Don't say it! Their HP is
already down to zero!

13:24.860 --> 13:26.440
Let's just watch from here on

13:26.440 --> 13:31.310
as the strongest players battle the 
strongest boss we've ever made.

13:31.310 --> 13:32.080
Yes.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.600
The tenth floor...

13:39.600 --> 13:41.250
Straight into a boss battle, huh?

13:47.190 --> 13:48.370
How's your condition?

13:48.370 --> 13:49.380
Perfect!

13:49.380 --> 13:50.370
Okay, then!

13:50.370 --> 13:51.680
Yeah! Let's go!

14:00.730 --> 14:01.830
Maple!

14:05.400 --> 14:08.360
<i>It's too heavy... and fast... and strong!</i>

14:11.870 --> 14:13.140
[Cover Move]!

14:13.140 --> 14:13.790
[Cover]!

14:18.620 --> 14:19.460
Nice!

14:20.910 --> 14:22.040
[Provocation]!

14:23.630 --> 14:25.210
[Deploy Armaments]!

14:25.210 --> 14:26.300
[Commence Attack]!

14:30.950 --> 14:32.510
One more time!

14:32.890 --> 14:33.350
Huh?

14:33.350 --> 14:34.820
Maple! Behind you!

14:42.610 --> 14:44.940
Fixed damage that can't be reduced?!

14:44.940 --> 14:45.750
We're in trouble!

14:51.070 --> 14:52.250
It's strong.

14:52.250 --> 14:54.950
Yeah, as you'd expect of 
the final boss in an event.

14:54.950 --> 14:56.330
What's our plan?

14:56.330 --> 14:58.260
I'll kill the boss's speed.

14:58.600 --> 15:01.910
Once it stops moving, we'll both 
throw our max firepower at it.

15:01.910 --> 15:03.670
That's a pretty simple plan.

15:03.970 --> 15:07.140
In that case, I'll be sure to keep you safe.

15:07.140 --> 15:08.630
Great, thanks!

15:08.970 --> 15:10.360
[Loving Sacrifice]!

15:10.360 --> 15:11.890
[Throne of the Heavenly King]!

15:12.260 --> 15:13.720
Oboro! [Awaken]!

15:19.100 --> 15:21.810
[Dark Fire]! [Torrent]! [Ancient Sea]!

15:36.980 --> 15:39.700
[Mirage]! [Double Slash]!

15:39.700 --> 15:41.540
Oboro! [Shadow Clone]!

15:51.130 --> 15:52.800
[Triple Slash]!

15:59.180 --> 16:00.520
What now?!

16:05.730 --> 16:07.250
It doesn't leave any openings.

16:13.110 --> 16:14.200
Maple! Now!

16:14.570 --> 16:16.320
[Frozen Earth]!

16:17.780 --> 16:19.490
[Power Attack]!

16:19.490 --> 16:22.960
[Hydra]! [Seeping Chaos]! [Predator]!

16:28.070 --> 16:29.250
It changed its pattern?!

16:33.080 --> 16:34.130
[Atrocity]!

16:46.050 --> 16:47.880
You okay, Maple?!

16:47.880 --> 16:50.940
Y-Yeah, pretty much...

16:51.180 --> 16:55.390
Cancel [Loving Sacrifice]. It'll be 
bad news if it uses an AoE attack.

16:55.390 --> 16:57.910
Got it. Make sure you dodge, okay?

16:57.910 --> 16:59.620
Yeah, I'll try.

16:59.620 --> 17:01.400
[Deploy Left Hand]!

17:01.400 --> 17:04.250
Here goes! Oboro, [Phantom World]!

17:05.830 --> 17:07.330
[Commence Attack]!

17:18.860 --> 17:20.600
And now...

17:22.540 --> 17:23.730
One more time!

17:27.650 --> 17:28.480
Sally!

17:29.030 --> 17:31.110
[Quintuple Slash]!

17:37.480 --> 17:39.490
We've almost got him! Keep it up!

17:39.490 --> 17:40.490
Yeah!

17:48.580 --> 17:52.320
Don't use [Cover Move]. It'll hurt too 
much now that our damage is doubled!

17:52.320 --> 17:53.480
Okay!

17:53.480 --> 17:54.470
[Provocation]!

17:54.470 --> 17:55.550
I'm counting on you!

17:57.010 --> 17:59.950
Syrup! [Awaken]! [Bastion]!

17:59.950 --> 18:01.850
Turtle! Tur...

18:03.060 --> 18:05.270
Turtle!

18:05.270 --> 18:06.600
Syrup!

18:06.600 --> 18:08.090
[Super Speed]!

18:11.060 --> 18:12.790
[Seeping Chaos]!

18:14.570 --> 18:15.940
This is insane!

18:15.940 --> 18:17.650
But we're almost there!

18:27.210 --> 18:29.830
<i>Shoot! I can't avoid it!</i>

18:30.090 --> 18:31.500
[Cover Move]!

18:31.840 --> 18:32.980
Maple?!

18:37.930 --> 18:38.970
Ow...

18:38.970 --> 18:40.020
[Heal]!

18:41.130 --> 18:42.550
[Frozen Earth]!

18:47.480 --> 18:48.890
[Break Core]!

18:51.020 --> 18:53.270
<i>[Break Core] takes five seconds to activate,</i>

18:53.600 --> 18:55.980
<i>and the freeze effect of [Frozen 
Earth] lasts three seconds.</i>

18:55.980 --> 18:57.130
<i>Meaning...</i>

18:57.130 --> 18:58.330
[Ice Pillar]!

18:58.330 --> 18:59.860
[Sand Wall]!

19:02.910 --> 19:04.990
Now we've got him!

19:15.530 --> 19:17.760
Y-You're kidding!

19:25.260 --> 19:28.080
<i>I told you not to use [Cover Move]!</i>

19:28.430 --> 19:29.250
But...

19:31.810 --> 19:34.060
I made it in time 'cause you protected me!

19:36.390 --> 19:37.320
[Empty Shell]!

20:05.150 --> 20:07.510
We won!

20:07.790 --> 20:10.350
That was crazy hard, but what did you think?

20:10.570 --> 20:13.850
Yeah! It was super fun!

20:14.770 --> 20:18.780
The first to conquer the tower was 
Payne's party, then Mii's party,

20:18.780 --> 20:21.470
and now Maple and Sally have cleared it, too.

20:21.830 --> 20:25.030
They fought so hard! I'm so moved!

20:25.030 --> 20:28.250
We're not trying to make a 
game that nobody can beat.

20:28.250 --> 20:31.000
We <i>want</i> people to beat our game.

20:31.000 --> 20:33.590
Yeah! That's right!

20:34.660 --> 20:35.960
I see.

20:35.960 --> 20:40.480
Well, they will earn silver medals 
and some new skills, as well.

20:40.480 --> 20:43.770
I just hope this doesn't turn 
into anything weird again.

20:43.770 --> 20:45.970
We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.

20:48.650 --> 20:50.340
[Water Manipulation], huh?

20:50.340 --> 20:53.020
And that skill lets you control water?

20:53.300 --> 20:56.010
I figured it could be interesting, 
depending on how it's used.

20:56.010 --> 20:58.770
And you got [Unbreakable Shield], huh?

20:58.770 --> 21:01.620
I did take a lot of damage this time,

21:01.620 --> 21:03.800
so I thought it could help me block more.

21:03.800 --> 21:06.740
Wow, so you're gonna be even tougher now?

21:07.430 --> 21:10.120
Oh, you guys got back before us?

21:10.120 --> 21:12.020
We just finished.

21:13.050 --> 21:14.330
Good job!

21:14.330 --> 21:16.570
I guess you beat us.

21:16.570 --> 21:19.390
Only Maple could conquer a 
tower like that on first sight.

21:19.390 --> 21:20.910
Yeah, but we...

21:20.910 --> 21:22.170
...fought hard, too!

21:22.170 --> 21:25.780
Anyway, we've all conquered the tower now.

21:25.780 --> 21:30.560
Maple, Maple! They're saying Level 7 
will come out after this event ends!

21:30.560 --> 21:32.180
Wow, really?

21:32.180 --> 21:35.270
Yeah! Let's all beat the 
Level 6 boss together!

21:35.270 --> 21:37.560
The Level 6... boss...

21:38.740 --> 21:42.480
Oh, yeah... I guess Sally 
can't beat Level 6...

21:42.480 --> 21:45.950
No problem! I know the perfect way!

21:54.120 --> 21:56.640
She won't have to see 
anything, but is this...

